{"type":"npc","name":"Ouveliste","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":240,"temp":0,"max":240,"details":""},"ac":{"value":32,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":40,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold-iron","value":10,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","fey"],"details":""},"level":{"value":12},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>With their macabre beauty and mesmeric juggling routine, the four-armed ouveliste is an alluring answer to desperate supplicants seeking to erase their traumatic memories. Ever-oozing wounds on their four palms weep shimmering blood and are both the source and the receptacle for the octahedral blood gems they juggle.</p><p>For oblivion seekers, the ouveliste's assurances of an untroubled mind are irresistible. However, the ouveliste revels in the chaotic consequences of forgetting that desperate minds do not foresee. They watch from shadowy corners as their victims' bewildered loved ones wonder what went wrong.</p><h2>Blood Bargain</h2><p>In order to suppress a creature's memories, an ouveliste clasps hands with a creature. When the handshake ends, the victim is left with a small, bloody wound on their palm—an injury that closes in minutes, leaving only a small scar. It's theorized that, along with memories, an ouveliste vampirically feeds on blood—or at least uses it to replace the blood that constantly oozes from the wounds on their own hands.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 250/560/1,030 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing, slashing), armor (light, medium), skill items (Acrobatics, Deception, Performance, Thievery)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, constitution, dexterity, elongating, energy resistant (vitality), intelligence, light, mind, mind shield, poison, poisonous armor, sensory (low-light vision), strength, throwing, wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Beth Breitmaier","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":7},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":4},"cha":{"mod":7}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":22,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":20,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":25,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":22,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":25},"deception":{"base":28},"performance":{"base":23},"thievery":{"base":25}},"traits":{"value":["fey"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"faKRfJyWYKxMHKRL","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/ouveliste.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Ouveliste","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/ouveliste.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/ouveliste.webp"}},"flags":{"sf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"type":"action","name":"Daturic Poison","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:29]</p><p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d4[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[3d4[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[4d4[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 3} (1 round)</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["poison"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"gASdSDLIqwyw88Ws","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Mesmeric Attack","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The ouveliste deals an additional 3d6 precision damage on melee Strikes to @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} creatures.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"diceNumber":3,"dieSize":"d6","key":"DamageDice","selector":"melee-damage","category":"precision","predicate":["target:condition:dazzled"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"coBQ15IpjOGp1usq","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Returning Gems","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>An ouveliste's blood gems have the <em>returning</em> property when thrown from their hands.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"Z2CA7r2erAQ6yAdO","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Forgetter's Bliss","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>An ouveliste targets an adjacent, willing creature and permanently suppresses all of the creature's memories of a particular person, incident, or conversation. If anyone mentions the suppressed subject to the creature, the creature takes @Damage[3d8[mental]] damage (@Check[will|dc:32|basic] save). A creature can only take damage in this way once per day. The next time it falls asleep, it forgets everything it has learned about the suppressed subject. The counteract DC for removing the curse with @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0] and similar effects is 32.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","curse","mental","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":3},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"w73Ob2fgw53JhbYX","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"False Fantasy","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The ouveliste spins a pleasant hallucination unique to each viewer. All @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} creatures within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:30] save against the hallucination and take @Damage[4d8[mental]] damage when the hallucination ends. Creatures that succeed at the save become temporarily immune to False Fantasy for 1 hour.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature mostly rejects the hallucination, but hazy images impair its vision. For 1 round, all creatures that are farther than 10 feet away from it are @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} to it. When the hallucination ends, they take half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is pulled into the hallucination. They experience the visual disturbances from a success, are @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}, and take full damage when the hallucination ends.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the visual disturbances last for 3 rounds, and the creature takes double damage when the hallucination ends.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","illusion","incapacitation","mental","primal","visual"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"ms9Hh1zokzyZi88h","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Beguiling Legerdemain","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The ouveliste juggles three glowing blood gems, mesmerizing onlookers. Creatures within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:32] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to Beguiling Legerdemain for 1 hour.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is dazzled for 3 rounds.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is dazzled for 6 rounds.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","light","manipulate","mental","primal","visual"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"roZqGmJXInLQqA3m","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},